ref_slice,\n        ref_len,\n        operation as i32,\n        flags,\n    ) as c_int\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":6,"newStart":6,"newLines":12,"lines":[" "," use std::os::raw::{c_char, c_int};"," ","+/// Buffer size assumed by the C driver `main` (`MAX_BUFFER_SIZE`). The C","+/// implementation's `strcmp` calls read past `input_len`/`ref_len`, relying","+/// on the caller having passed a stack array of this size. We mirror that","+/// assumption here.","+const MAX_BUFFER_SIZE: usize = 1024;","+"," /// C-ABI export matching the C function:"," ///"," /// ```c"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
